h thức và địa chỉ giao hàng mà có thể phát sinh thêm chi phí khác như phí vận chuyển, phụ phí hàng cồng kềnh, thuế nhập khẩu (đối với đơn hàng giao từ nước ngoài có giá trị trên 1 triệu đồng).....</p>","images":[{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/82/22/73/7498924c7c499ab6b0c8968c752a1d84.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/82/22/73/7498924c7c499ab6b0c8968c752a1d84.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/82/22/73/7498924c7c499ab6b0c8968c752a1d84.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/82/22/73/7498924c7c499ab6b0c8968c752a1d84.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/82/22/73/7498924c7c499ab6b0c8968c752a1d84.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/a2/c3/00/12161f3ad40bb650f531fe823a2f313a.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/a2/c3/00/12161f3ad40bb650f531fe823a2f313a.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/a2/c3/00/12161f3ad40bb650f531fe823a2f313a.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/a2/c3/00/12161f3ad40bb650f531fe823a2f313a.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/a2/c3/00/12161f3ad40bb650f531fe823a2f313a.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/c2/ae/95/8bdc53c1a44e8848008217559cb84e3a.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/c2/ae/95/8bdc53c1a44e8848008217559cb84e3a.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/c2/ae/95/8bdc53c1a44e8848008217559cb84e3a.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/c2/ae/95/8bdc53c1a44e8848008217559cb84e3a.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/c2/ae/95/8bdc53c1a44e8848008217559cb84e3a.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.co